WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.200 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:54.200 --> 01:57.520
BAIHU HALL

02:17.120 --> 02:18.920
Her Ladyship
has a few heartfelt words for you.

02:19.440 --> 02:20.880
Listen carefully, General.

02:21.600 --> 02:24.840
Before entering the palace, she sent out
two hundreds homing pigeons to the people.

02:25.560 --> 02:27.400
You may order your men to shoot them down,

02:28.000 --> 02:30.760
but if even one pigeon
makes it out of the city,

02:31.360 --> 02:32.800
war will break out in flames.

02:33.480 --> 02:36.640
Once word spreads that the Crown Prince
killed his father to seize power,

02:36.720 --> 02:39.960
the regional garrisons and feudal lords
will all rise against him.

02:40.040 --> 02:42.160
How will you withstand them, General Han?

02:42.960 --> 02:44.920
If you want
the Crown Prince to take the throne,

02:45.000 --> 02:46.560
you must negotiate with Her Ladyship.

02:47.600 --> 02:49.360
She's cautious indeed.

02:50.040 --> 02:52.960
She knew this rabble
couldn't keep her alive,

02:53.640 --> 02:55.800
so she prepared a fallback plan.

02:55.880 --> 02:57.000
Very well.

02:57.600 --> 02:59.400
I'll negotiate with her.

03:00.800 --> 03:03.200
All of you, wait outside!

03:24.360 --> 03:27.520
If I didn't know
you'd just lost your husband,

03:28.280 --> 03:31.560
I'd think you were about to get married.

03:32.160 --> 03:36.560
That outfit is quite dazzling.

03:38.240 --> 03:39.320
Don't I look beautiful?

03:46.640 --> 03:47.880
You do.

03:47.960 --> 03:53.240
In this lifeless court,
you're the most dazzling flower.

03:53.840 --> 03:55.480
A pity you're poisonous.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.560
Let's get to the point.

04:03.160 --> 04:05.320
You're helping
the Crown Prince seize the throne.

04:05.920 --> 04:08.000
He'll never spare my mother or me.

04:08.600 --> 04:10.120
I'd like to ask you

04:11.480 --> 04:12.760
to protect my entire clan.

04:12.840 --> 04:16.880
Liu Shuo has probably been captured
by Grand Commandant Zheng.

04:17.600 --> 04:20.640
You two siblings led troops
into the palace at night.

04:20.720 --> 04:22.760
You clearly intended to rebel.

04:24.560 --> 04:26.280
If the Crown Prince quells the rebellion

04:26.360 --> 04:28.400
and takes the throne,
that's only reasonable.

04:33.480 --> 04:36.400
If we can settle this without bloodshed,

04:36.960 --> 04:39.000
I'd rather avoid a massacre.

04:40.520 --> 04:44.160
Now, everyone's life

04:47.080 --> 04:49.840
depends on your decision.

04:58.480 --> 04:59.800
What do you want, General?

04:59.880 --> 05:02.960
You and the Crown Prince
are mortal enemies.

05:03.480 --> 05:05.360
To save you and your mother,

05:06.920 --> 05:08.240
there's only one way.

05:10.560 --> 05:12.320
You must become my wife.

05:15.000 --> 05:18.240
I've only just lost my husband,
and you want me to remarry?

05:20.840 --> 05:21.760
Drop the act.

05:22.600 --> 05:24.600
I've seen right through you.

05:26.000 --> 05:28.320
Deep down, you're selfish,

05:28.400 --> 05:30.680
cold-hearted, and ruthless.

05:31.720 --> 05:33.480
No one craves the climb more than you.

05:35.080 --> 05:37.520
Didn't you marry Lu Zhuo for power?

05:39.320 --> 05:41.040
Whatever he offers you,

05:41.880 --> 05:43.960
I can give you too.

05:47.480 --> 05:49.160
I've plotted against the Hans before.

05:49.240 --> 05:51.720
I've built up quite a grudge with you.

05:52.320 --> 05:56.040
I'm afraid you'll break your word
and settle the score later.

06:01.160 --> 06:03.440
Others worship you as a goddess,

06:03.960 --> 06:06.560
but I want that goddess in my arms.

06:12.040 --> 06:17.960
Why plot for your brother
when you could plot for your own husband?

06:18.640 --> 06:19.760
Wei Rao,

06:20.800 --> 06:23.200
I'm giving you one final chance.

06:23.960 --> 06:25.400
If you refuse,

06:26.240 --> 06:27.720
I'll order the city put to the sword.

06:28.600 --> 06:33.560
The first to die will be your own mother.

06:35.480 --> 06:38.320
Think carefully.

06:46.960 --> 06:47.840
I'll marry you.

06:50.640 --> 06:51.480
Really?

07:00.840 --> 07:01.760
You…

07:05.240 --> 07:06.280
You…

07:07.520 --> 07:09.200
You vile woman…

07:09.280 --> 07:10.600
Poison!

07:12.120 --> 07:14.360
He knew I'd like to have a blade
beneath my pillow.

07:15.880 --> 07:17.240
He didn't blame me for it,

07:18.440 --> 07:20.160
instead, he gave me this ring.

07:23.320 --> 07:25.000
How could you ever compare to him?

07:28.320 --> 07:30.240
Xiao! Now!

07:31.000 --> 07:32.560
By imperial decree, Noble Lady Wu'an
is here to purge the treacherous.

07:32.640 --> 07:34.320
Lay down your weapons before the Zi hour,

07:34.400 --> 07:36.200
and you shall be pardoned.

07:36.280 --> 07:38.320
Anyone who continues
to side with the rebels

07:39.280 --> 07:40.360
will be eliminated!

07:42.640 --> 07:44.760
Your Highness, the Empress Dowager
is confined to Changle Palace for now.

07:46.640 --> 07:47.800
Your Highness,

07:49.080 --> 07:50.760
you mustn't hesitate now.

07:54.320 --> 07:55.280
Search!

07:55.360 --> 07:57.680
Find the Imperial Seal at all costs!

08:02.840 --> 08:04.160
Guard His Majesty.

08:14.040 --> 08:15.240
That's oil.

08:16.160 --> 08:18.400
Wei Rao, what are you doing?

08:26.240 --> 08:29.000
Your Highness, you've stormed
the palace in the dead of night.

08:29.080 --> 08:30.960
What exactly do you intend?

08:31.040 --> 08:34.280
To kill the wicked consort
and rid Father's court of evil, of course.

08:37.240 --> 08:39.720
Your Highness, we've searched everywhere.
No sign of the seal.

08:41.520 --> 08:42.720
Where is it?

08:43.320 --> 08:46.640
His Majesty is gravely ill
and allows only me to attend to him.

08:47.280 --> 08:50.720
I'm the only one
who knows where the Imperial Seal is.

08:51.320 --> 08:53.920
Hand over the seal,
and I may leave your corpse intact.

08:54.960 --> 08:56.680
I want to see my daughter.

08:57.720 --> 08:59.320
My whole life,

09:01.120 --> 09:02.280
my mother,

09:02.880 --> 09:05.560
my father and my grandmother,

09:06.880 --> 09:08.840
they all wanted something,

09:10.280 --> 09:12.520
and all of it mattered more than me.

09:23.840 --> 09:25.720
Only he was different.

09:30.560 --> 09:32.080
He stayed by my side

09:32.840 --> 09:34.080
and cared for me.

09:36.240 --> 09:38.800
Even though I pushed him away
again and again,

09:42.640 --> 09:45.360
he'd always hold me close again,

09:46.880 --> 09:48.800
asking nothing in return.

09:50.000 --> 09:51.680
In this world,

09:53.800 --> 09:55.720
he was the only one who put me first.

09:57.440 --> 09:59.360
No one could ever replace him.

10:02.000 --> 10:06.000
But you killed him.

10:07.200 --> 10:09.360
How dare you kill my husband?

10:19.720 --> 10:22.000
The truth is, whether he lives

10:24.400 --> 10:25.880
or dies matters not,

10:29.400 --> 10:31.080
he belongs to me.

10:35.920 --> 10:38.640
I want this love to
last through every lifetime,

10:39.440 --> 10:40.960
never to fade.

10:45.320 --> 10:47.440
So why should I fear death?

10:49.840 --> 10:50.680
Wei Rao,

10:52.320 --> 10:54.400
-don't…
-Don't worry.

10:57.280 --> 10:59.040
Once I've killed you,

10:59.120 --> 11:00.880
I'll go after the Crown Prince!

11:56.280 --> 11:59.280
Han Liao tried to turn
Qi Zhongkai and me against each other.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.720
So I devised a plan to fake my death
and lure the enemy in.

12:02.760 --> 12:04.000
That day in the Death Valley,

12:04.680 --> 12:06.800
I led my men out
along a path on the cliff face

12:07.320 --> 12:09.480
and left a body I'd prepared
in advance in my place.

12:10.680 --> 12:15.600
General Lu has fallen,
taking the Hutuo soldiers with him!

12:30.680 --> 12:34.320
In every lifetime,
she will always be my wife.

12:35.200 --> 12:38.120
As for you, you can go to hell.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.280
BAIHU HALL

13:03.800 --> 13:04.640
Your Highness,

13:04.720 --> 13:06.680
Noble Lady Wu'an wants to
burn General Han alive!

13:06.760 --> 13:08.840
Rao! My Rao!

13:09.600 --> 13:10.480
Where is the seal?

13:10.560 --> 13:13.120
I swear on my honor as Crown Prince
to spare you and your daughter.

13:13.200 --> 13:14.320
I'll keep my word!

13:15.360 --> 13:16.720
One last lesson for you.

13:17.320 --> 13:20.320
Break your word,
and even if you win the throne,

13:20.840 --> 13:21.840
you won't keep it.

13:23.400 --> 13:26.280
The seal is buried in the peach grove
southeast of Xuanshi Palace.

13:26.920 --> 13:28.600
Go and dig it up yourself!

13:29.120 --> 13:30.080
-Hurry!
-Rao!

13:30.160 --> 13:31.320
Find the seal!

13:31.400 --> 13:32.640
-Yes.
-The Crown Prince gave his word.

13:32.720 --> 13:33.560
-All of you, go!
-Rao!

13:33.640 --> 13:34.480
But I didn't.

13:36.640 --> 13:37.920
Rao!

13:38.520 --> 13:39.440
Rao!

13:43.400 --> 13:45.000
Rao!

13:46.360 --> 13:47.240
Shoot!

13:48.240 --> 13:49.680
Rao!

13:51.640 --> 13:52.680
-General Lu.
-General Lu!

13:53.280 --> 13:55.000
-Rao!
-Mother!

14:00.680 --> 14:03.720
We've followed General Lu's plan
and secured the Imperial City.

14:03.800 --> 14:05.120
Zheng Tan has been captured.

14:06.680 --> 14:08.160
Rao!

14:14.200 --> 14:15.120
Seize the rebel leader!

14:15.720 --> 14:16.880
Charge!

14:24.960 --> 14:26.040
What did you…

14:27.840 --> 14:29.400
What did you just call me?

14:31.000 --> 14:32.520
I heard everything.

14:35.040 --> 14:38.640
You offered the Imperial Seal
in exchange for my life.

14:44.960 --> 14:49.840
How could the Imperial Seal
matter more than my precious daughter?

15:03.960 --> 15:04.840
Everyone, stop!

15:17.120 --> 15:18.040
Aman,

15:19.720 --> 15:22.200
Wei Shu is gone. Go.

15:23.400 --> 15:24.440
Find her.

16:05.160 --> 16:07.720
When the Fourth Prince
was brought into the palace,

16:08.240 --> 16:10.040
I said I wanted to
come and have a look too.

16:11.440 --> 16:15.000
I'm glad I came.

16:16.000 --> 16:18.600
Make her suffer every punishment

16:19.440 --> 16:22.600
she inflicted on those innocent girls

16:24.200 --> 16:26.360
before sending her to the scaffold.

16:33.360 --> 16:36.600
Let go of me! Let go!
I'm the Crown Princess!

16:36.680 --> 16:38.720
A lowly woman like you
has no right to judge me!

16:39.760 --> 16:40.800
Where's Wei Rao?

16:41.480 --> 16:42.960
Ask her to come and speak to me.

16:44.120 --> 16:46.440
What? Is she afraid?

16:47.200 --> 16:50.400
That's because she's a night-soil woman.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.440
A night-soil woman!

16:54.560 --> 16:56.640
-Let go!
-Had my sister been in your place tonight,

16:56.720 --> 16:58.360
she'd have marched straight in,

16:58.440 --> 17:00.320
held the Emperor to command the realm.

17:01.000 --> 17:04.119
But to settle a private grudge,
you went straight to Zhuyu Estate

17:04.720 --> 17:06.960
and wasted your best chance.

17:07.560 --> 17:12.000
You're too foolish and shortsighted
to be a worthy opponent for my sister.

17:15.200 --> 17:16.040
Take her away.

17:17.119 --> 17:19.359
Wei Rao!

17:19.440 --> 17:21.359
Come out!

17:26.359 --> 17:28.359
My voice sounds awful.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.040
Xiao,

17:34.600 --> 17:36.520
the guilty have been punished,

17:37.480 --> 17:41.600
and those who died unjustly
can finally rest in peace.

17:42.120 --> 17:42.960
They will.

17:43.880 --> 17:45.280
And I wish you, Lady Hongxian,

17:46.120 --> 17:49.560
all the happiness you hope for
and a smooth road ahead.

18:02.840 --> 18:05.600
I was blind drunk last night
and couldn't come to your aid in time.

18:05.680 --> 18:06.880
Please forgive me, Father.

18:06.960 --> 18:09.640
I've arrested every member
of the traitorous Zheng family.

18:10.760 --> 18:13.960
Better to arrive late
than to join the wrong side.

18:15.240 --> 18:17.360
Liu Shou has committed high treason

18:18.200 --> 18:19.520
and violated the bonds of family.

18:20.560 --> 18:21.720
He is stripped of his rank

18:23.600 --> 18:24.560
and ordered

18:26.800 --> 18:28.000
to take his own life.

18:29.600 --> 18:31.680
On an auspicious day,
I shall inform the ancestors

18:32.400 --> 18:35.000
of the appointment of
my fourth son, Liu Shuo, as heir,

18:35.840 --> 18:37.200
to secure the realm.

18:42.000 --> 18:43.880
So that's it.

18:44.760 --> 18:47.080
You were waiting
until Liu Shuo was strong enough

18:47.840 --> 18:50.960
to inherit the throne before deposing me.

18:51.560 --> 18:53.600
You foresaw trouble in the palace

18:53.680 --> 18:56.080
and immediately sent men to protect him.

18:56.160 --> 18:59.920
Through all of it, Liu Shuo's hands
are the only ones that never shed blood.

19:01.680 --> 19:03.000
Father,

19:03.640 --> 19:05.480
how could you be so biased

19:08.200 --> 19:09.880
and so unfair?

19:13.040 --> 19:14.000
Guards.

19:26.360 --> 19:27.320
Liu Ding,

19:28.840 --> 19:30.640
if you dare harbor treasonous thoughts,

19:31.920 --> 19:33.440
let his fate be a warning.

19:34.960 --> 19:36.840
I would never dare, Father!

19:40.000 --> 19:41.040
Wei Rao.

19:46.840 --> 19:47.840
Your Majesty.

19:48.760 --> 19:52.000
I've seen all that you've done.

19:52.760 --> 19:56.400
You've carried on your father's legacy,
stayed true to your country,

19:57.280 --> 20:00.800
served its people,
and remained loyal to your sovereign.

20:01.480 --> 20:03.160
Quelling the rebellion, founding the realm

20:03.240 --> 20:04.640
a great service to the state.

20:05.240 --> 20:08.760
I hereby name you
the Princess Protector of the Realm

20:08.840 --> 20:10.400
and add 5000 households to your fief.

20:11.680 --> 20:14.200
I thank Your Majesty for this honor.

20:17.520 --> 20:18.640
Rise.

20:24.760 --> 20:25.920
Lu Zhuo.

20:28.840 --> 20:29.800
Your Majesty.

20:30.400 --> 20:32.200
Shuo is Wei Rao's brother.

20:33.600 --> 20:35.520
Henceforth, treat him
not as your sovereign,

20:35.600 --> 20:37.840
but as your own brother,

20:38.680 --> 20:41.920
guiding him whenever he strays
and supporting him wholeheartedly.

20:42.520 --> 20:44.880
I shall do all I can

20:45.640 --> 20:47.080
to live up to Your Majesty's trust.

20:56.280 --> 20:57.160
Father.

21:01.680 --> 21:02.800
Shuo,

21:03.600 --> 21:04.880
in three days,

21:05.400 --> 21:08.000
I shall preside over
your coming-of-age ceremony.

21:21.560 --> 21:24.680
XUANSHI PALACE

21:41.440 --> 21:42.840
An emperor's mind

21:44.000 --> 21:45.400
is truly unfathomable.

21:46.000 --> 21:47.920
He wasn't only testing
the deposed Crown Prince.

21:49.800 --> 21:50.640
He was testing you too.

21:54.880 --> 21:55.920
Testing me?

21:59.080 --> 22:00.040
Your Highness,

22:00.760 --> 22:01.640
General Lu,

22:04.280 --> 22:05.920
shouldn't you be thanking your matchmaker?

22:06.720 --> 22:08.160
What do you mean?

22:08.240 --> 22:11.120
The plan was to test you,
but Lu Zhuo refused to go along with it,

22:11.200 --> 22:12.880
so I gave him a stronger dose

22:12.960 --> 22:15.040
and stop Zhao Song from sending word.

22:15.120 --> 22:17.280
Otherwise, how would we know
your true feelings?

22:17.360 --> 22:18.520
-You…
-Lu Zhuo,

22:19.040 --> 22:20.040
you owe me your thanks.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.600
Where else would you find one

22:23.120 --> 22:24.960
so selfless, seeking no reward?

22:26.360 --> 22:28.080
So that's what happened.

22:30.400 --> 22:31.240
That's right.

22:31.320 --> 22:32.880
I certainly owe you my thanks!

22:32.960 --> 22:35.160
The general repays kindness with violence!

22:36.120 --> 22:39.240
Your Highness, mind your manners.

22:45.080 --> 22:46.280
Tell me.

22:46.800 --> 22:48.280
When did you wake up in the coffin?

22:49.600 --> 22:53.440
Just in time to hear you say
that our bond is unbreakable

22:53.520 --> 22:54.640
and you can't do without me.

22:55.360 --> 22:57.200
‎All right, okay, my fault.

23:01.600 --> 23:02.840
How can you cast me aside
after all I've done?

23:02.920 --> 23:04.360
-Wait up!
-I know.

23:04.960 --> 23:05.800
-It's my fault.
-Your Majesty,

23:06.320 --> 23:08.400
why not set state affairs aside for now

23:08.480 --> 23:10.240
and go recover at the traveling palace?

23:10.320 --> 23:11.280
No, I can't.

23:11.880 --> 23:16.600
I must see Shuo secure on the throne.

23:17.640 --> 23:18.640
Otherwise,

23:20.120 --> 23:22.160
I won't be able to rest in peace.

23:30.280 --> 23:32.680
Shuo is still young.

23:34.080 --> 23:37.000
The feudal lords
won't respect his authority.

23:37.720 --> 23:40.040
To secure his throne,

23:41.560 --> 23:44.320
he'll need his sister's reputation
with the people

23:44.400 --> 23:47.960
as well as the support
from Lu Zhuo and the others.

24:10.080 --> 24:13.280
The Emperor departed this life
in the early summer of the next year.

24:13.840 --> 24:16.440
Crown Prince Liu Shuo ascends the throne,

24:16.520 --> 24:19.120
ushering in the Xihe era.

24:19.200 --> 24:21.640
‎XUANSHI PALACE

25:02.480 --> 25:04.360
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

25:04.440 --> 25:07.920
FOURTH MONTH OF THE THIRD YEAR OF XIHE

25:14.960 --> 25:17.320
SHIZHAI

25:42.040 --> 25:42.920
To kill at close range,

25:43.520 --> 25:45.640
you can't rely only on tricks
like hidden weapons.

25:46.600 --> 25:49.960
This move is called Redirecting Force.

25:56.480 --> 25:57.520
Be serious.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.600
Like this?

26:10.800 --> 26:14.240
I'm not showing you.
You'll only blame me again.

26:23.480 --> 26:25.640
My brave and mighty general,

26:27.720 --> 26:29.240
am I doing it right?

26:45.600 --> 26:46.880
SONGYUE HALL

26:53.440 --> 26:55.360
Your Highness,
Hongxian has sent a secret message.

26:55.440 --> 26:56.560
His Majesty fell from his horse
while hunting and was badly injured.

26:56.640 --> 26:58.600
She asks you to enter the palace at once.

27:16.080 --> 27:18.640
Your Majesty. Your Majesty.

27:20.320 --> 27:21.320
Your Majesty.

27:25.320 --> 27:26.360
Your Majesty.

27:39.440 --> 27:41.640
Rao, you're here.

27:42.680 --> 27:44.680
Mother cried so hard she fainted.

27:44.760 --> 27:47.280
I've had her taken
back to her palace to rest.

27:47.920 --> 27:51.080
His Majesty has been waiting for you.

27:52.280 --> 27:55.160
It was getting late,
and the weather in the mountains turned.

27:55.760 --> 27:56.680
I advised to return,

27:56.760 --> 27:57.880
but he insisted on
hunting down that wild fox.

27:58.880 --> 27:59.920
Then we encountered a bear.

28:00.560 --> 28:02.480
Who knew there would be a bear there?

28:02.560 --> 28:04.160
It suddenly charged at us
and killed two guards.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.600
-His Majesty…
-His Majesty needs to rest.

28:07.360 --> 28:09.040
Please leave, Prince Fu.

28:25.120 --> 28:28.040
It was him. It was him!

28:29.840 --> 28:31.960
He led His Majesty into those woods.

28:33.320 --> 28:35.360
His Majesty just sent him off to his fief

28:35.440 --> 28:36.800
and then this happened.

28:37.400 --> 28:40.440
Rao, he's the culprit.

28:42.480 --> 28:43.560
Rao.

28:44.320 --> 28:45.520
I'm here.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.680
What do you want to say?

28:48.400 --> 28:50.640
When Father died,

28:51.280 --> 28:55.400
he told me to be kind
to my only remaining brother.

28:56.320 --> 28:59.440
Though you urged me
time and again to kill him,

29:00.200 --> 29:03.360
I always showed him leniency.

29:03.440 --> 29:06.600
I know. I know you did.

29:07.360 --> 29:08.400
For three years,

29:09.600 --> 29:13.800
he was cautious
and respectful in every way.

29:14.440 --> 29:15.520
But all along,

29:16.160 --> 29:17.680
he was lying low,

29:18.560 --> 29:20.560
waiting for his chance.

29:20.640 --> 29:22.000
Tomorrow's the day,

29:22.520 --> 29:25.000
once in three years,

29:25.080 --> 29:28.440
when the feudal lords come to the capital
to pay their respects.

29:31.280 --> 29:33.560
Stop talking. You need to rest.

29:35.120 --> 29:36.040
Your Majesty…

29:37.720 --> 29:39.960
Shuo…

29:41.280 --> 29:42.120
Your Majesty…

29:44.160 --> 29:48.720
I thought I'd live a hundred years,

29:49.440 --> 29:52.240
long enough to be a worthy emperor.

29:53.040 --> 29:57.080
Together, we can build

29:58.400 --> 29:59.920
an age of peace and prosperity.

30:02.080 --> 30:03.400
I never thought…

30:06.280 --> 30:07.840
I never thought

30:08.600 --> 30:12.920
I wouldn't live to see tomorrow's dawn.

30:15.520 --> 30:17.480
-Your Majesty…
-Rao.

30:17.560 --> 30:19.080
-I'm here.
-Rao.

30:19.160 --> 30:21.360
I'm here.

30:22.440 --> 30:23.360
I…

30:24.880 --> 30:26.240
I'm so afraid.

30:27.240 --> 30:28.240
Don't be afraid.

30:28.760 --> 30:31.400
I'm here. Don't be afraid, Shuo.

30:32.600 --> 30:34.600
It's not fair.

30:35.120 --> 30:36.560
It's not fair.

30:56.280 --> 30:57.200
Shuo.

30:58.760 --> 30:59.640
Your Majesty…

30:59.720 --> 31:01.200
Shuo.

31:06.320 --> 31:10.200
Shuo!

31:11.080 --> 31:12.240
Your Majesty!

31:14.720 --> 31:16.200
Your Majesty!

31:18.840 --> 31:20.360
What ominous signs?

31:20.440 --> 31:21.760
Didn't I succeed?

31:21.840 --> 31:24.360
If I'd known,
I wouldn't have waited three years.

31:24.440 --> 31:27.120
All just a woman's foolish fears.
I should've made my move long ago.

31:32.800 --> 31:34.040
Lu Zhuo, what are you doing?

31:34.640 --> 31:37.120
This is the imperial palace.
How dare you do as you please here?

31:38.680 --> 31:39.760
Seize him.

31:43.040 --> 31:46.120
Lu Zhuo, I'm the late Emperor's son.

31:46.680 --> 31:48.200
You can't kill me.

31:49.000 --> 31:52.440
I want to see
the Grand Empress Dowager! I insist!

31:53.320 --> 31:55.040
If the Princess Protector
of the Realm wants you dead,

31:56.040 --> 31:58.120
you must have committed
an unforgivable crime.

31:58.920 --> 32:00.200
You won't get the chance.

32:06.320 --> 32:07.240
My Lord,

32:07.320 --> 32:09.880
Prince Rong and 13 other feudal lords
have arrived in the capital.

32:10.400 --> 32:13.400
The Grand Empress Dowager
hosts a grand banquet to welcome them.

32:14.240 --> 32:17.040
Prince Fu is the guest of honor.

32:22.240 --> 32:24.000
BAIHU HALL

32:24.080 --> 32:25.920
It seems they've chosen the next Emperor.

32:28.080 --> 32:29.840
Poor Shuo.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.200
How despicable they are!

32:34.520 --> 32:35.560
Let's go.

32:36.920 --> 32:38.120
To Xuanshi Palace.

32:46.400 --> 32:47.400
It's over.

32:48.960 --> 32:50.720
It's all over.

32:51.600 --> 32:53.240
The princes will
enter the palace tomorrow.

32:53.840 --> 32:57.040
With His Majesty dead,
the realm will fall into chaos.

32:58.200 --> 33:01.440
Of the late Emperor's sons,
only Prince Fu remains.

33:01.520 --> 33:03.360
Prince Fu is dead!

33:06.960 --> 33:12.600
His Majesty loved his brother
and chose him to join him in death.

33:19.640 --> 33:20.840
By now,

33:23.000 --> 33:27.080
he's followed His Majesty
to the underworld.

33:30.880 --> 33:31.760
But

33:33.040 --> 33:34.800
Prince Rong is still alive.

33:35.480 --> 33:39.120
The Grand Empress Dowager will surely put
her youngest son on the throne.

33:40.200 --> 33:41.840
Once he takes the throne,

33:41.920 --> 33:44.840
the Empress Dowager,

33:45.360 --> 33:47.560
you, the Princess Protector
of the Realm, and I

33:47.640 --> 33:49.760
will all be doomed.

33:59.000 --> 34:00.840
Oh, Heaven.

34:03.080 --> 34:04.520
Why?

34:06.640 --> 34:08.000
Why?

34:10.239 --> 34:14.199
Whenever I think
things are finally getting better,

34:15.120 --> 34:17.520
you just cast me back into the abyss,

34:19.520 --> 34:20.679
driving me

34:22.560 --> 34:27.400
into despair again and again?

34:33.040 --> 34:35.760
How much more
do you want to put me through?

34:35.840 --> 34:39.320
Is seeing me in agony
the only thing that satisfies you?

34:41.679 --> 34:42.840
Why?

34:45.199 --> 34:47.560
Why?

34:48.159 --> 34:50.040
Shuo!

34:50.560 --> 34:52.840
Shuo!

34:56.880 --> 34:58.040
Rao.

35:44.080 --> 35:45.520
Open the doors

35:47.120 --> 35:48.520
and all the windows.

36:07.560 --> 36:09.160
Issue my orders.

36:10.960 --> 36:12.480
His Majesty has passed away.

36:13.640 --> 36:15.840
The Grand Empress Dowager is in mourning

36:17.200 --> 36:20.160
and should not receive the feudal lords.

36:22.160 --> 36:25.080
As Princess Protector of the Realm,

36:26.960 --> 36:29.560
I shall receive them instead.

37:27.640 --> 37:30.120
XUANSHI PALACE

37:37.240 --> 37:40.520
Whatever trials and disasters
may befall me,

37:41.800 --> 37:43.520
I'll get through them all.

37:45.160 --> 37:47.720
I'll find a way to make them submit.

37:49.320 --> 37:52.120
Everything will get better,

37:53.680 --> 37:55.640
as long as I live.

37:57.720 --> 38:00.440
As long as I am alive.

38:00.520 --> 38:02.800
‎THE END

40:09.800 --> 40:12.800
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
